  "body": "- Lot 1 - SOLD \r\n- Lot 2 - SOLD\r\n\r\nWelcome to this beautifully crafted, brand-new residence in the highly desirable Torbay, where refined design meets modern family living. The naturally light-filled living and dining area is complemented by high-quality finishes, creating a warm and sophisticated atmosphere. Perfectly positioned close to excellent schools, local shops, and beautiful beaches and parks, this home offers the ideal balance of convenience and coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n* 4 spacious bedrooms & 2.5 well-appointed bathrooms\r\n* Low-maintenance, perfect for an easy-care lifestyle\r\n* Naturally light-filled living and dining areas with quality finishes\r\n* Designer kitchen featuring quality appliances and ample storage\r\n* Internal access single garage with EV pre-wired plus plenty of street parking\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow for effortless entertaining and everyday living\r\n* Built-in sound system and smart video intercom system for enhanced comfort and security\r\n* 10 Year Stamford Building Warranty Insurance\r\n\r\nThis beautiful home won't stay long on the market. Don't miss the opportunity to secure this exceptional home. \r\n\r\nContact Catherine 02102006788 or Barry 0225067888 today for more information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nPhoto disclaimers: Some photos taken from other lots. For reference ONLY",
